# .cursorrules — PROJECT AR: COMPLETE MASTER SYSTEM BLUEPRINT & SYSTEM INSTRUCTIONS (V6 — THREE.JS / GLB)
========================================================================================================
Project Title: Project AR: Aishwarya’s 30th Birthday Scrapbook Quest ✨
Theme: "The Search for a Stray Heart"
Visual Identity: Deep Velvet Great Hall Night (#0F0A1C), Aged Parchment Scroll (#F5E6C8), Gold Filigree (#D4AF37), Crimson Wax Seal, Soft Cream & Blush Linen (#FFFBF7).
Shared theme tokens: `src/theme.js` (keep DOM + Three.js colors in sync).
Narrator Engine: Living 3D "Mini-Me" Husband Avatar + "Ginger" Orange & White Tabby Cat Companion (Three.js WebGL + GLB).

This file is the SINGLE COMPREHENSIVE SOURCE OF TRUTH for Cursor AI. It contains all screens/phases, 3D/WebGL architecture, companion director behaviors, exact wording, sound cues, state machine flow, WebAR engine, failsafes, and the full 30-step scavenger hunt card mapping.

**Stack:** Vite + React + `three` (raw WebGL scenes; GLTF via `three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js`). Prefer StackBlitz / GitHub for remote preview; audio MP3s may be added later without blocking visuals.

---

## 🎯 1. MASTER STATE MACHINE & SCREEN SEQUENCE

The application follows a strictly bound 5-phase sequential state machine (`src/App.jsx`):

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        MASTER PRODUCTION STATE FLOW                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ PHASE 1: SCREEN 1 — LUMOS GATEWAY & UNBOXING RITUAL                         │
│  • 3D Ribbon Scroll + Crimson Wax Seal "30" (Three.js ClosedScroll3D)       │
│  • EnchantedCanvas3D Great Hall (candles, fireflies, owls/bats, broom)      │
│  • Living MiniMeAvatar3D + GingerCat3D (GLB → demo CDN → procedural)        │
│  • Companion Director: random peek / walk-in / smile / lean / cute cat      │
│  • Action: Tap Wax Seal "30" ➔ sfx_wax_crack ➔ Parchment Scroll Unrolls     │
│  • Action: Tap "I ACCEPT THE WIZARDING QUEST ✨"                            │
│                                                                             │
│ PHASE 2: FLOO NETWORK VORTEX TRANSITION (~1.6 seconds)                      │
│  • Emerald & Gold GPU particle swirl on EnchantedCanvas3D (flooActive)      │
│                                                                             │
│ PHASE 3: SCREEN 2 — 99% SWEETNESS OVERLOAD PRANK                            │
│  • Loading bar rushes (10% → 45% → 72% → 88% → 99% FROZEN!)                  │
│  • 3D Mini-Me & Ginger pose="glass" (hands/paws press screen glass)         │
│  • Coral-Pink Warning Pop-up: "...girl with TWO university degrees! 🎓🎓"   │
│  • Action: Tap Mini-Me's face ➔ Unlocks WebAudio, plays chipmunk giggle,    │
│    cat purr (sfx_cat_purr), fires heart confetti, advances state!           │
│                                                                             │
│ PHASE 4: SCREEN 3 — INTRO ROMANTIC VIDEO MONTAGE                            │
│  • Full-screen YouTube Unlisted Video Embed (9:16 vertical)                 │
│  • Friends' birthday wishes + romantic memory compilation + AI Uncle video  │
│  • Action: Video ends / "Continue to Quest" ➔ Opens AR Scanner              │
│                                                                             │
│ PHASE 5: SCREEN 4 — WEBAR SCAVENGER HUNT & ANAGRAM WORKBENCHES (Steps 1–30) │
│  • Chapter 1 (Steps 1–10) ➔ Anagram Workbench: MICROWAVECUPBOARD            │
│  • Chapter 2 (Steps 11–20) ➔ Anagram Workbench: GOLDJEWELRYPOUCH            │
│  • Chapter 3 (Steps 21–30) ➔ Anagram Workbench: UNDERSTAIRS (Grand Vault)   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

