## 🎭 2. LIVING COMPANION ENGINE (MINI-ME & GINGER — THREE.JS)

### A. Architecture (source of truth)
| Piece | Path |
| :--- | :--- |
| Mini-Me viewport | `src/components/MiniMeAvatar3D.jsx` |
| Ginger viewport | `src/components/GingerCat3D.jsx` |
| GLB config | `src/config/companionModels.js` |
| GLTF load / fit / mixer | `src/utils/gltfCharacter.js` |
| Random behavior director | `src/hooks/useCompanionDirector.js` |
| Behavior catalog | `src/utils/companionBehaviors.js` |
| Dispose helpers | `src/utils/threeDispose.js` |
| Legacy 2D (unused fallback) | `MiniMeAvatar.jsx`, `GingerCatCompanion.jsx` |

**Load priority (do not break):**
1. Local GLB: `/public/models/minime.glb` and `/public/models/ginger.glb`
2. Else CDN demo GLBs (RobotExpressive / Fox) so StackBlitz stays visual
3. Else procedural Pixar-style primitive meshes

**Animation:** `AnimationMixer` + clip aliases from `companionModels.js`. Root staging (`peek`, `walkIn`, `lean`, `leap`, etc.) applied even when clips are missing. Dispose all geometries/materials/renderer on unmount.

### B. Mini-Me Avatar3D
* **Visuals:** Stylized 3D character (cardigan, gold chain, diamond stud when procedural; final look from `minime.glb`).
* **Idle:** Float + breathe; blink; stud sparkle / chain sway (procedural); GLB idle clip when present.
* **Poses:** `idle`, `talk`, `smile`, `lean`, `peek`, `walkIn`, `yarn`, `scratch`, `bump`, `glass`.
* **Mouth / lip-sync:** Speech bubble anchored to projected 3D mouth (or jaw/head bone). `talking` + `audioEngine.getLipAmplitude()` drives mouth flap / jaw.
* **Intro speech (once on scroll open):**
  > 💬 **Gokul-Mage:** *"Aishwarya! Gokul-Mage lost a piece of Gokul's heart in our home! Help me find it! 💖"*
* **Idle chatter (director):** rotates `voice_idle_1`–`3` lines from `companionBehaviors.js`.

### C. Ginger Cat3D
* **Visuals:** Orange & white tabby (procedural fur shader or `ginger.glb`).
* **Idle:** Tail swish, ear twitch, paw bat, blink.
* **Cute poses:** `stretch`, `loaf`, `lick`, `bat`, `roll`, `sleep`, `nuzzle`, plus `leap`, `sit`, `yarn`, `scratch`, `bump`, `glass`, `peek`, `walkIn`.
* **Touch:** Tap plays `sfx_cat_purr` (silent if missing) + pastel heart fountain.

### D. Companion Director (`useCompanionDirector`)
* Active on Screen 1 after scroll opens; paused during NO trap.
* Interval ~6.5–11s; weighted random behaviors (peek, walk_in, smile, lean_touch, yarn, scratch, bump, ginger_*, talk).
* On open: `playIntro()` → talk pose + `voice_quest_intro` (or chirp fallback).
* On NO trap: `playTrap()` → Mini-Me peek + Ginger leap + trap line.

### E. Cat Assist on "NO" Disillusionment Trap
* When Aishu tries to hover or tap **"No, thanks 😜"**:
  1. The "NO" button teleports away (`1px solid #D4AF37` gold border, gold pill background `rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2)`, bright glowing text `#FFE5A3`).
  2. Ginger leaps onto the button (`pose="leap"`) with `sfx_cat_meow`.
  3. Mini-Me peeks with speech: *"Nice try, my love! Ginger and I say only YES works! 😜"* (`voice_no_nice_try`).
  4. Audio engine invokes `stopAllSFXAndVoices()` first so sounds never overlap or clip.

