## 🌌 3. 3D GREAT HALL ATMOSPHERE (`src/components/EnchantedCanvas3D.jsx`)

* **Engine:** Full-screen Three.js WebGL — `PerspectiveCamera`, ambient + studio point lights, fog, geometry dispose on unmount.
* **Props:** `lumosOn` (boost intensity / Lumos trail), `flooActive` (emerald–gold vortex particles).
* **Scene content (clutter-free):**
  * 2–3 floating candles with flame **shader** + point lights
  * Hogwarts envelopes drifting in depth
  * GPU fireflies (yellow-green) + gold stardust
  * Owl / bat silhouette sweeps
  * Diagonal flying broomstick
  * Interactive **Lumos wand trail** (pointer/touch → diamond-gold sparks)
* **Legacy:** `EnchantedCanvas.jsx` (2D canvas) is superseded; App must use `EnchantedCanvas3D`.

---

## 📜 4. INTERACTIVE WAX-SEAL PARCHMENT SCROLL (`src/components/Screen1Gateway.jsx`)

* **Initial State:** Three.js closed ribbon scroll + crimson wax seal **"30"** (`ClosedScroll3D` inside gateway).
* **Unboxing:** Tap seal → `sfx_wax_crack` → seal crack anim → parchment unrolls downward.
* **Parchment:** Compact (`max-width: 360px`), semi-transparent (`rgba(245, 230, 200, 0.82)` + `backdrop-filter: blur(8px)`) so the 3D hall stays visible.
* **Typography:**
  * Header: `✨ HOGWARTS SECRET PROTOCOL 0510 ✨`
  * Title: `THE SEARCH FOR A STRAY HEART`
  * Proclamation: *"Thirty years of magic..."* gold-foil gradient (`linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0C2, #D4AF37)`)
  * YES: `🪄 I ACCEPT THE WIZARDING QUEST ✨`
* **Companions:** Wired through `useCompanionDirector` → `MiniMeAvatar3D` + `GingerCat3D`.

---

## 💖 5. SCREEN 2: 99% SWEETNESS OVERLOAD PRANK (`src/components/Screen2Prank.jsx`)

* **Loading Progress Bar:** Rushes quickly (10% → 45% → 72% → 88% → 99%) and **FREEZES at 99%**.
* **Glass Pane:** `MiniMeAvatar3D` + `GingerCat3D` with `pose="glass"`.
* **Coral-Pink Warning Pop-up:**
  > *"✨ OH NO! SWEETNESS OVERLOAD! ✨ The Wellington wind must have blown away our connection! 💨 But wait... my heart-meters show this phone is being held by a girl with TWO university degrees! 🎓🎓 Your brilliant brain and breathtaking beauty have completely melted my little birthday servers! 💘 Quick, tap my face to give me a kiss and fix the system!"*
* **Face-Tap:** Unlocks WebAudio / BGM; `voice_tap_yay` + `sfx_cat_purr` + chipmunk giggle + heart confetti → `video_montage`.

---

## 🎬 6. SCREEN 3: INTRO ROMANTIC VIDEO MONTAGE (`src/components/ScreenVideoMontage.jsx`)

* **Video Container:** Full-screen responsive 9:16 vertical YouTube Unlisted embed.
* **Content:** Friends/family wishes, romantic memories, AI uncle tribute.
* **Controls:** Autoplays after Screen 2 audio unlock; gold button `✨ Continue to Scavenger Hunt ➔`.

